      "rationale": "The three-condition A/B/C ablation cleanly isolates the grammar effect, and the coverage-guarantee argument (even 0% violation rate cannot guarantee proportional rare-role coverage) is a genuinely novel theoretical framing. No directly competing concurrent work was found. However, this remains primarily an empirical/engineering contribution (XGrammar pipeline integration) rather than algorithmic novelty."
