    "impact": {
      "score": 3,
      "rationale": "If C outperforms B on rare-role strata, this is a useful finding for synthetic EAE data generation; the stratified evaluation adds mechanistic interpretability. But if the delta is negligible even in rare strata, the result approaches a null finding, and the coverage guarantee becomes an unvalidated theoretical claim — limiting its broader impact."
